rdiskinfo-bin (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of RDiskInfo v0.1.0 for Ubuntu / Kubuntu / Linux Mint /
    Pop!_OS (22.04+, 24.04+, 26.04+).
  * Cross-protocol Linux S.M.A.R.T. and disk diagnostics viewer (ATA/SATA,
    NVMe, SCSI/SAS/USB) with desktop entry, 512x512 icon, and Polkit policy.

